{"4286270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Train Arrives at 10 PM", "steam_appid": 4286270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Train Arrives at 10 PM is a psychological visual novel focused on grief, memory, and the choices we wish we could change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet, repetitive life slowly drifts toward the same inevitable moment — the evening, when the train arrives at the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286270/extras/0d217856e5047a5ab5b3a2386c994cdc.poster.avif?t=1784332172\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286270/extras/0d217856e5047a5ab5b3a2386c994cdc.webm?t=1784332172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar scenes begin to shift, revealing new details, buried emotions, and uncomfortable truths. What starts as an ordinary routine gradually turns into a psychological descent, where every decision carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286270/extras/1013c4df9ce325d5da53c33ff0197b5b.poster.avif?t=1784332172\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286270/extras/1013c4df9ce325d5da53c33ff0197b5b.webm?t=1784332172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A story-driven psychological visual novel  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Meaningful choices that influence t